        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_comp_prep_create",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_comp_prep_create\n\nExport lod_ost_alloc_rr(), lod_ost_alloc_qos(), lod_comp_prep_create(),\nlod_lu_ops and lod_thread_key, with KUNIT_STATIC_STUB_REDIRECT() on the\ntwo allocators and on lod_qos_declare_object_on(), so a kunit test can\nforce RR or QoS and fake object declaration without a mounted\nfilesystem or OSD/OSP.\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/lod_comp_test.c covering FLR cross-mirror OST\navoidance, EC data/parity/raid-set allocation, mixed PFL+EC layouts,\nOSTs down/full/read-only/degraded/out of precreated objects (including\nQoS->RR fallback), and RR spreading across OSSs - mirroring the\nallocation cases from sanity-ec 2b, 2c, 11, 13, 27a, 35a, 35b and 75c.\nA few known-issue cases (too few failure domains) are added skipped\nuntil the desired behavior is decided.\n\nRun from sanity test_51k, loading kunit on the MDS with enable=1.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5\nChange-Id: I5bb4457e21845e13f6e1503924954c0c94a8e0c1\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
